This folder contains model files from face-api.js by Vladimir Mandic
(https://github.com/vladmandic/face-api, npm @vladmandic/face-api 1.7.13),
licensed under the MIT License (see LICENSE in this folder).
The weight files were renamed (.bin to .wasm) so that the hosting service serves them,
and the "paths" entry of each *-weights_manifest.json was changed to the new file name.
The weights themselves are unchanged.
